<title>JAPAN: Dennys Japan -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dennys Japan -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Reveneu	     53.06		vs	   51.48</p>
<p> Operating	    4.64		vs	    3.63</p>
<p> Current		4.83		vs	    3.89</p>
<p> Net		    2.35		vs	    1.85</p>
<p> EPS		   79.81 yen	  vs	   63.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     29 million	  vs	  29 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 15.00 yen	  vs	   14.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Dennys Japan Co Ltd is a restaurant operator affiliated with Ito-Yokado Co Ltd.</p>
